{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Crystal Valley</strong>, you explore alien landscapes, mine raw materials, craft new tools, and fight against countless enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an exciting adventure, battle evil monsters, and create powerful weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken with no memory of who you are or how you got here. Beside you lie an axe, a pickaxe, and a note.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The note reads:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect 50 crystals to open the portal.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine raw materials and use them to craft new tools and weapons. Gather crystals to create portals and travel to new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight a variety of enemies with your weapons, from ghosts to skeletons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful \u2014 when you die, it\u2019s all over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crystal Valley</strong> is built around replayability. Every run is different, giving you a fresh experience each time and plenty of reasons to come back.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"288c3875dfd52cb8fd77725b6e6d1b13b60a2fac.jpg","localized_name":"Welcome ","name":"Welcome ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1305430/288c3875dfd52cb8fd77725b6e6d1b13b60a2fac.jpg"},{"icon":"6d491099903fecc24390fd3906dd87dba06e78e9.jpg","localized_name":"First Death","name":"First Death","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1305430/6d491099903fecc24390fd3906dd87dba06e78e9.jpg"},{"icon":"958d139ece1a4e5ba62675a8ecd91a7b03af8fdf.jpg","localized_name":"HEALING","name":"HEALING","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1305430/958d139ece1a4e5ba62675a8ecd91a7b03af8fdf.jpg"},{"icon":"264c2a105f30dba3d0e1c6e35acc82cfe43e5